{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016sakqDn3YkFxxXJVJvBSxq","type":"tool_result","content":"**Search costs:**\n- **Basic search:** 1 API credit per request.\n- **Advanced search:** 2 API credits per request.\n\n**Plan tiers:**\n\n| Plan | Credits per month | Monthly price |\n|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | 1,000 | Free |\n| Project | 4,000 | $30 |\n| Bootstrap | 15,000 | $100 |\n| Startup | 38,000 | $220 |\n| Growth | 100,000 | $500 |\n| Pay as you go | Per usage | $0.008 per credit |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efef9612-4c8f-46cd-9164-fb2f178828a5","uuid":"4e7e6245-544d-4528-a351-36b2fab71451","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:36:24.450Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":3382,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Search costs:**\n- **Basic search:** 1 API credit per request.\n- **Advanced search:** 2 API credits per request.\n\n**Plan tiers:**\n\n| Plan | Credits per month | Monthly price |\n|---|---|---|\n| Researcher | 1,000 | Free |\n| Project | 4,000 | $30 |\n| Bootstrap | 15,000 | $100 |\n| Startup | 38,000 | $220 |\n| Growth | 100,000 | $500 |\n| Pay as you go | Per usage | $0.008 per credit |\n| Enterprise | Custom | Custom |","durationMs":2293,"url":"https://docs.tavily.com/documentation/api-credits"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016sakqDn3YkFxxXJVJvBSxq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg8DP8WKWygAXcNirNv3N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For about 15k searches a month, the cheapest option depends on how many credits each search uses.\n\n**Credits per search:** a basic search costs 1 credit and an advanced search costs 2.\n\n| Searches/month | Credits needed | Best option | Cost/month |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 15k basic | 15,000 | **Bootstrap** (15,000 credits) | **$100** |\n| 15k advanced | 30,000 | **Startup** (38,000 credits) | **$220** |\n| 15k basic, with headroom | 15,000+ | Pay as you go, $0.008/credit | $120 for exactly 15k |\n\n- **Basic searches:** Bootstrap at $100 covers exactly 15,000 credits, so you'd have no buffer. Pay as you go would cost $120 for the same volume. A few extra searches on Bootstrap would likely still cost less than Startup, but check how Tavily handles overage.\n- **Advanced searches:** 15k advanced searches would cost $240 on pay as you go. Startup at $220 is cheaper and leaves about 8,000 credits spare.\n- **Mixed use:** work out your credits as basic count + 2 × advanced count, then pick the smallest plan that covers it.\n- **Other endpoints:** extract and crawl may use credits differently, so check the docs if you'll use them.\n- **Free options:** the free Researcher plan only includes 1,000 credits. Tavily also has a separate startup program with 100k free credits, if you qualify.\n\nThe prices come from Tavily's pricing and docs pages today. Check the pricing page before you buy, since plans change.\n\nSources:\n- https://www.tavily.com/pricing\n- https://docs.tavily.com/documentation/api-credits"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":19400,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":424},"output_tokens":579,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efef9612-4c8f-46cd-9164-fb2f178828a5","uuid":"3cb1380d-a6fd-4834-8c6c-64c63095fbd4","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:36:29.027Z","request_id":"req_011Cg8DP8DiYHkdLaPD4duXP"}
